#: ../../source/recipes/glm5_3.rst:6
msgid ""
"A large Mixture-of-Experts model using **Dynamic Sparse Attention "
"(DSA)**, continuing the :doc:`GLM-5.1 / GLM-5.2 <glm5_2>` line "
"(architecture ``GlmMoeDsaForCausalLM``, 78 layers, ``index_topk`` 2048). "
"Unlike :doc:`DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash <deepseek_v41_flash>`, this checkpoint "
"presents a **single KV cache group** to the connector, so no per-group "
"tuning is needed."
msgstr ""

